.TH dalgona-plugin 1  "dalgona-plugin " 
.SH NAME
dalgona\-plugin \- Manage configured plugin grants.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgona\-plugin\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage configured plugin grants.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgona\-plugin\-grant(1)
Grant the configured capabilities declared by NAME.
.TP
dalgona\-plugin\-revoke(1)
Revoke every persistent grant for NAME.
.TP
dalgona\-plugin\-list(1)
List configured plugins and their persistent grants.
.TP
dalgona\-plugin\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
